      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON SWING (1) broke from the inside draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 0.8 lengths (22.87) behind Paw Prydi at Geelong. Well placed and gets her chance. EQUITY (5) was well fancied last time on the strength of the win two back but could only manage third (22.40) at Q Lakeside. Can measure up. ANTI VENOM (8) goes very well this course and distance starting 17 times for six wins and eight minors. Was out of the placings last time (19.96) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing fifth and beaten 3 lengths. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts.",
